:&lt;sup&gt;'''3'''&lt;/sup&gt; ''The discovery of an expert [[Catalan language|Catalan]] [[archaeologist]] [[Pere Bosch-Gimpera]]''.
:&lt;sup&gt;'''4'''&lt;/sup&gt; ''See English translation of Charles C. Mierow:'' http://www.acs.ucalgary.ca/%7Evandersp/Courses/texts/jordgeti.html

