  <page>
    <title>Cretheus</title>
    <id>80971</id>
    <revision>
      <id>31450752</id>
      <timestamp>2005-12-15T09:58:21Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>TheKMan</username>
        <id>632866</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>Reverted edits by [[special:contributions/212.219.188.4|212.219.188.4]] ([[user_talk:212.219.188.4|talk]]) to last version by GeeJo</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Cretheus''', or '''Krêtheus''' was the king and founder of [[Iolcus]].  His wives were [[Sidero]], [[Tyro]] and either [[Demodice]] or [[Biadice]].  His parents were [[Aeolus]] and [[Enarete]].  With Tyro, he fathered [[Aeson]], [[Pheres]], and [[Amytheon]].



[[Category:Greek mythological people]]{{Greek-myth-stub}}</text>
