      <comment>robot  Adding: pl</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Sidero''' (&quot;the Iron One&quot;) was the second wife of [[Salmoneus]] and stepmother of the twins [[Pelias]] and [[Neleus]].  She mistreated the twins' mother [[Tyro]] horribly, incurring their wrath when they reached adulthood.  Although Sidero fled from them into [[Hera]]'s district, Pelias nevertheless murdered her atop the altar to Hera.

{{greek-myth-stub}}

[[Category:Greek mythological people]]

[[pl:Sidero]]</text>
