      <text xml:space="preserve">{{Infobox CVG |title= Grim Fandango
|image= [[Image:Gim fandango cover.jpg|center|200px|Grim Fandango Lucas Arts Classics Cover]]
|developer= [[LucasArts]]
|publisher= [[LucasArts]]
|designer= [[Tim Schafer]]
|engine= [[GrimE]]
|released= [[1998 in video gaming|1998]]
|genre= [[Adventure game]]
|modes= [[Single player]]
|ratings= [[ESRB]]: Teen, [[ELSPA]]: +11
|platforms= [[Microsoft Windows|Windows]]
|media= [[Compact disc|CD]] (2)
|requirements= [[Intel Pentium]] 133 [[Central processing unit|CPU]], 32MB [[Random access memory|RAM]], 20MB [[hard disk]] space, 2MB PCI [[Graphics processing unit|GPU]]
