    <title>Aircraft part</title>
    <id>81074</id>
    <revision>
      <id>41374429</id>
      <timestamp>2006-02-26T22:45:43Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Last Malthusian</username>
        <id>414388</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>Stub-sorting  ([[WP:WSS|You can help!]])</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Aircraft parts''' are components manufactured to be used on [[aircraft]]. Many companies around the world specialize in making aircraft parts.  Because of strict regulations on aircraft [[maintenance]] in most countries, aircraft parts must often be certified by regulatory agencies, and for this reason are often considerably more expensive than comparable uncertified parts.

'''See also:''' [[aircraft manufacturers]]
[[Category:Aerospace engineering]]

{{Aero-stub}}</text>
