      <text xml:space="preserve">:''This article is about Cannes, the French city. You may be looking for the [[Cannes Film Festival]].''
{{French commune|nomcommune=Cannes&lt;br&gt;[[Image:Cannes Overview.jpeg|300px]]&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;Overview of Cannes from Le Suquet&lt;/small&gt;
|région=[[Provence-Alpes-Côte d'Azur]]
|département=[[Alpes-Maritimes]]
|arrondissement=Grasse
|canton=Chief town of 2 cantons
|insee=06029
|cp=06400
|maire=Bernard Brochand
|mandat=[[2001]]-[[2007]]
|intercomm=
|longitude=07° 01' 20&quot; E
|latitude=43° 33' 12&quot; N
|alt moy=
|alt mini=0 m
|alt maxi=260 m
|hectares=1,962
|km²=19.62
|sans=67,304
