      <text xml:space="preserve">:''For the town in France, see [[Ersa, Haute-Corse]].''

In [[Greek mythology]], '''Ersa''' was the goddess of [[dew]] and a daughter of [[Zeus]] and [[Selene]]. In other stories however, Ersa is instead the daughter of Zeus and [[Eos]].

