  <page>
    <title>Duckworth the Butler</title>
    <id>81133</id>
    <revision>
      <id>36742333</id>
      <timestamp>2006-01-26T03:47:50Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <ip>172.169.77.45</ip>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">[[Image:Duckworth.jpg|160px|thumb|Duckworth]]'''Duckworth''' is a fictional character from the television series ''[[DuckTales]]'', where he is [[Scrooge McDuck]]'s [[butler]]. He was voiced by [[Chuck McCann]]. 

He worked for Scrooge even before the nephews moved in. He is also Scrooge's [[chauffeur]] and errand boy on occasion. Duckworth used to be Scrooge's only household servant until Scrooge hired [[Mrs. Beakley]]. His only starring roles on the show were &quot;Duckworth's Revolt&quot; and &quot;Take Me Out of the Ball Game&quot;. He first appeared in the pilot episode of ''DuckTales''. He usually appears as a supporting character. Although his name is Duckworth, he was never really a duck at all, he was a dog.  

Duckworth is a [[jack-of-all-trades]] in the [[McDuck]] mansion, making him an important member of Scrooge's staff.

{{Disney-stub}}
[[Category:Characters in the Scrooge McDuck universe]]
[[Category:Fictional dogs]]</text>
    </revision>
  </page>
  <page>
    <title>Chief O'Hara</title>
    <id>81134</id>
    <revision>
      <id>37361137</id>
      <timestamp>2006-01-30T14:39:10Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Demiurge</username>
        <id>72235</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>rv vandal</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''John O'Hara''' is a fictional character, the diminuitive Chief of Police in the [[Mickey Mouse universe]]. He plays a supportive role in [[Mickey Mouse]]'s comic book mysteries as an incapable policeman who often relies on Mickey's help to catch characters such as [[Black Pete]], [[Phantom Blot]] and the like. Known fellow officers include his friend, [[Detective Casey]].

O'Hara also appeared on ''[[Mickey Mouse Works]]'' and ''[[House of Mouse]]''.

== History ==

The character was conceived by [[Floyd Gottfredson]] (and [[Merrill De Maris]]) for [[Walt Disney Pictures|Disney]] in the late 1930's.



{{disney-stub}}
[[Category:Mickey Mouse universe characters|O'Hara, Chief]]

[[it:Adamo Basettoni]]
[[fi:Simo Sisu]]
[[fr:Commissaire Finot]]
[[sv:Kommissarie Karlsson]]</text>
