      <text xml:space="preserve">'''The Pianist''' may be:
* [[The Pianist (1991 film)]], a 1991 film
* [[The Pianist (1998 film)]] (El Pianista), a 1998 Catalan film
* [[The Pianist (memoir)]], a biographical memoir by Polish pianist Władysław Szpilman
* [[The Pianist (film)]], a 2002 [[Roman Polanski]] film based on the memoir
* ''Die Klavierspielerin'', a novel by [[Elfriede Jelinek]]'s, known in English as ''The Pianist''.

==See also==
* [[Pianist]], about pianists in General

