* For the story by [[Edith Wharton]] see [[Xingu (story)]]
* Xingu is a brand of [[Brazil|Brazilian]] black [[beer]].  It has a distinct, almost [[cola]]-like, flavor. It is sometimes categorized as a sweet [[stout]].
* Xingu is the name of a character in [[James Thurber|James Thurber's]] children's book, ''The 13 Clocks''
