    <title>AIX</title>
    <id>81194</id>
    <revision>
      <id>40037038</id>
      <timestamp>2006-02-17T17:49:48Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>RoboDick</username>
        <id>815650</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>robot  Adding: it, pl, sv</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">__NOTOC__
== AIX ==
'''AIX''' is a [[three-letter abbreviation]] with multiple meanings, as described below:

*[[Athens Internet Exchange]], a European [[Internet Exchange Point]]
*[[AIX operating system]], the brand name of IBM's proprietary UNIX operating system, where &quot;AIX&quot; stands for &quot;Advanced Interactive eXecutive&quot;

== Aix ==
'''Aix''' as a word or part of a name can also refer to:
*[[Aix (genus)|''Aix'' (genus)]], a [[genus]] of two [[species]] of [[dabbling duck]]s, the [[Wood Duck]] (''Aix sponsa'') and the [[Mandarin Duck]] (''Aix galericulata'')

=== Place names ===
*[[Aix-la-Chapelle]] (Germany), also known as &quot;Aachen&quot;

==== France ====
*[[Aix, Corrèze]], in the [[Corrèze]] ''[[département in France|département]]''
*[[Aix, Nord]], in the [[Nord]] ''département''
*[[Aix-en-Diois]], in the [[Drôme]] ''département''
*[[Aix-en-Ergny]], in the [[Pas-de-Calais]] ''département''
*[[Aix-en-Issart]], in the Pas-de-Calais ''département''
*[[Aix-en-Othe]], in the [[Aube]] ''département''
*[[Aix-en-Provence]], in the [[Bouches-du-Rhône]] ''département''
*[[Aix-la-Fayette]], in the [[Puy-de-Dôme]] ''département''
*[[Aix-les-Bains]], in the [[Savoie]] ''département''
*[[Aix-Noulette]], in the Pas-de-Calais ''département''
*[[Île-d'Aix]], island and commune of the [[Charente-Maritime]] ''département''
*[[Aixe-sur-Vienne]], in the [[Haute-Vienne]] ''département''

== See also ==
{{PrefixAllPages|Aix}}

{{TLAdisambig}}

