      <comment>recat</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''AWeb''' is a [[web browser]] for the [[Amiga]] range of computers. Originally developed by Yvon Rozijn, AWeb was shipped with version 3.9 of [[AmigaOS]], and is now [[Open source|open source]].

AWeb supports HTML3.2, and some 4.1, Javascript, frames, [[Transport Layer Security|SSL]], and various other Netscape and IE features.

==See also==
*[[IBrowse (web browser)|IBrowse]]
*[[Voyager (web browser)|Voyager]]

==External link==
