      <text xml:space="preserve">'''IBrowse''' is a [[web browser]] for the [[Amiga]] range of computers. IBrowse was originally developed for a company called [[Omnipresence]], now defunct. The original author has since continued development of IBrowse.

IBrowse supports [[HTML]], and some HTML 4, [[JavaScript]], frames, [[Transport Layer Security|SSL]], and various other standards.

IBrowse has been rumored to be included with the new 4.0 version of [[AmigaOS]].

