*[http://volcano.und.nodak.edu/vwdocs/volc_images/europe_west_asia/vulcano.html Photos and explanatory captions]
*[http://www.ct.ingv.it/UfMoni/ Live webcam of Vulcano - click on &quot;Webcam&quot;]

