      <text xml:space="preserve">:''Not to be confused with the neighboring province of [[Shaanxi]]''
{{Infobox PRC province |
  Header         = '''&amp;#23665;&amp;#35199;&amp;#30465;&lt;br&gt;Sh&amp;#257;nx&amp;#299; Sh&amp;#283;ng'''
| Name           = Shanxi
