* [http://rick_oleson.tripod.com/looking_forward.htm Looking Forward]: rangefinder design in the context of viewfinder design, by Rick Oleson. Excellently illustrated.
* [http://medfmt.8k.com/mf/roland.html Roland rangefinder camera]
* [http://www.cameraquest.com/classics.htm CameraQuest's Classic Camera Profiles]
