* [http://homepage.mac.com/mattdenton/photo/cameras/rangefinders.html Matt's Classic Cameras - Rangefinders &amp; Compacts]
* [http://graflex.org/speed-graphic/features.html Graflex Speed Graphic]
* [http://www.xs4all.nl/~lommen9/kalart/index.html Kalart range finder]
