      <contributor>
        <username>Kurieeto</username>
        <id>130639</id>
      </contributor>
      <comment>Cat move: History of Canada -&gt; Aboriginal peoples in Canada</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Nitassinan''' is the ancestral homeland of the [[Innu]], an [[Aboriginal peoples in Canada|Aboriginal peoples]] in Eastern [[Canada]].  The territory covers most of the [[Québec-Labrador peninsula]].

{{canada-stub}}
{{ethno-stub}}
