* [[Canton of Geneva]], Switzerland
* [[Genetic engineering]] (g.e.)
* [[General Electric]] (GE)
* [[Nikolai Ge]] (1831–1894), a Russian painter
* [[Gigabit Ethernet]], a networking technology

