      <comment>Added box</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">{| class=&quot;infobox&quot; cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2 rules=rows align=&quot;right&quot; font=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;font-size:85%; width:25em; border-collapse:collapse; border:1px solid black;&quot;
|- ! style=&quot;background:LightBlue;&quot;
| style=&quot;font-size: larger;&quot; align=&quot;center&quot; colspan=&quot;2&quot; | '''Parlophone Records'''
|-
| colspan=&quot;4&quot; | [[Image:Parlophone.jpg.gif|center|125px|]]
|-
| align=&quot;right&quot; | '''Parent company'''
| [[EMI]]
