  <page>
    <title>Northridge, Los Angeles, California</title>
    <id>81584</id>
    <revision>
      <id>42153469</id>
      <timestamp>2006-03-04T04:17:01Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Mrquizzical</username>
        <id>991348</id>
      </contributor>
      <comment>removed vandalism</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Northridge''' is a community in the [[Los Angeles, California|City of Los Angeles]], [[United States|USA]].  It is located in the [[San Fernando Valley]], north of the [[Santa Monica Mountains]].  

The community is relatively square in shape, bordered by the communities of [[Reseda, Los Angeles, California|Reseda]] and [[Winnetka, Los Angeles, California|Winnetka]] to the south, [[Chatsworth, Los Angeles, California| Chatsworth]] to the west, [[Porter Ranch, Los Angeles, California|Porter Ranch]] to the north-west, [[Granada Hills, Los Angeles, California|Granada Hills]] to the north-east, [[North Hills, Los Angeles, California|North Hills]] to the east, and [[Van Nuys, Los Angeles, California|Van Nuys]] to the south-east.  Major thoroughfares include Roscoe Boulevard, Tampa Avenue, Reseda Boulevard, and Zelzah Avenue, as well as Chatsworth, Devonshire, Lassen, Plummer, and Nordhoff Streets.

The [[1994 Northridge Earthquake]] is named for the community based on early estimates of the location of the quake's [[epicenter]]; however further refinements showed it to be technically in neighboring [[Reseda, Los Angeles, California|Reseda]]. The area was also heavily damaged in the [[1971]] [[Sylmar earthquake]].

In 1994, the Northridge [[Little League]] Baseball team won the United States Little League Championship game, but lost the World Series game to the international team from [[Coquivacoa-Maracaibo, Venezuela]].


== Interesting Facts ==
*[[Nancy Cartwright (actress)|Nancy Cartwright]], the actress best known as the voice of [[Bart Simpson]], was named &quot;Honorary Mayor of Northridge&quot; in 2005 by the North Valley Regional Chamber of Commerce.  This is a purely honorary position; Northridge is not an incorporated city in its own right and does not have an actual city government.
* Kevin Keene, the hero of the cartoon [[Captain N: The Game Master]] was from Northridge.

==Points of interest==

* [[California State University, Northridge]] ([[CSUN]]).
* [[California State University Northridge Botanic Garden]]
* [[Northridge Fashion Center]], a large shopping mall.

==External links==
*North Valley Regional Chamber of Commerce: http://nvrcc.com/
*[http://www.northridgecouncil.org/ Northridge Neighborhood Council]

[[Category:Los Angeles neighborhoods]]

[[es:Northridge (California, Estados Unidos)]]</text>
    </revision>
