      <comment>pt:</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">[[Image:Map of Colorado counties, labelled.svg|thumb|300px|right|Colorado counties]]

List of 64 [[county|counties]] in the [[U.S. state]] of [[Colorado]]:

* [[Adams County, Colorado|Adams County]] - formed in 1902 from part of Arapahoe county.
* [[Alamosa County, Colorado|Alamosa County]] - formed in 1913 from parts of Conejos and Costilla counties.
* [[Arapahoe County, Colorado|Arapahoe County]] - one of the original 17 counties.
* [[Archuleta County, Colorado|Archuleta County]] - formed in 1885 from part of Conejos county.
* [[Baca County, Colorado|Baca County]] - formed in 1889 from part of Las Animas county.
* [[Bent County, Colorado|Bent County]] - formed in 1874 from part of Greenwood county.
* [[Boulder County, Colorado|Boulder County]] - one of the original 17 counties.
* [[Broomfield County, Colorado|Broomfield County]] - formed in 2001 from parts of Adams, Boulder, Jefferson and Weld counties.
* [[Chaffee County, Colorado|Chaffee County]] - formed in 1879 from part of Lake county.
* [[Cheyenne County, Colorado|Cheyenne County]] - formed in 1889 from parts of Bent and Elbert counties.
* [[Clear Creek County, Colorado|Clear Creek County]] - one of the original 17 counties.
* [[Conejos County, Colorado|Conejos County]] - one of the original 17 counties. Originally also known as Guadalupe county
* [[Costilla County, Colorado|Costilla County]] - one of the original 17 counties.
* [[Crowley County, Colorado|Crowley County]] - formed in 1911 from part of Otero county.
* [[Custer County, Colorado|Custer County]] - formed in 1877 from part of Fremont county.
* [[Delta County, Colorado|Delta County]] - formed in 1883 from part of Gunnison county.
* [[Denver County, Colorado|Denver County]] - formed in 1902 from part of Arapahoe county.
* [[Dolores County, Colorado|Dolores County]] - formed in 1881 from part of San Juan county.
