* [[Mineral County, Colorado|Mineral County]] - formed in 1893 from parts of Hindsdale and Rio Grande counties.
* [[Moffat County, Colorado|Moffat County]] - formed in 1911 from part of Routt county.
* [[Montezuma County, Colorado|Montezuma County]] - formed in 1889 from part of La Plata county.
