==Defunct counties==

* [[Greenwood County, Colorado|Greenwood County]] - formed in 1870 from part of Huerfano county and the Arapahoe and Cheyenne Reserve. In 1874 was abolished and Bent and Elbert counties created.
* [[Platte County, Colorado|Platte County]] - formed in 1872 from part of Weld county. In 1874 was abolished and its territory returned to Weld county...

