===CSUN in film===
Because of its proximity to Hollywood, CSUN has been featured in dozens of films and television shows. You can see it in [[Six Feet Under]], [[The Karate Kid]], [[Battlestar Galactica]], [[McMillan and Wife]], [[Son-in-Law]], [[Bring It On Again]], [[Legally Blonde 2]], and [[Sky High]] (where the Oviatt Library is prominently featured).

