        <username>Edgar181</username>
        <id>491706</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>disambiguation link repair ([[Wikipedia:Disambiguation pages with links|You can help!]])</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Keto acids''' are [[organic compound|organic]] [[acid]]s containing a [[ketone]] group along with the [[acid]] groups; 
*alpha-keto [[acid]] refers to a 2-oxo [[acid]] ([[pyruvic acid]]); 
*beta-keto [[acid]] refers to a 3-oxo [[acid]] ([[acetoacetic acid]]), etc.

