      <minor />
      <comment>robot  Adding: es</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Clymenus''', or '''Klyménos''' (&quot;notorious&quot;) may refer to any number of individuals:

*Clymenus was the father of [[Eurydice]].
*Clymenus was the son of King [[Aeneas]] of [[Calydon]].
*Clymenus was a King of [[Olympia, Greece|Olympia]].
*Clymenus was a King of [[Arcadia]].
*Clymenus was a King of [[Boeotia]] and father of [[Phaeton]] by [[Merope]].
*Clymenus was also an alternate name for [[Hades]].

[[Category:Greek mythological people]]

[[es:Clímeno]]</text>
