  <page>
    <title>Iasion</title>
    <id>81699</id>
    <revision>
      <id>33533730</id>
      <timestamp>2006-01-02T00:26:43Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Ceyockey</username>
        <id>150564</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>categorized</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Iasion''' or '''Iasus''' was usually the son of [[Electra]] and [[Zeus]] and brother of [[Dardanus]]. Iasion founded the mystic rites on the island of [[Samothrace]]. With [[Demeter]], he was the father of [[Plutus]].  Because of his [[hubris]], Iasion was killed by Zeus with a [[thunderbolt]].

==External link==
* [http://www.theoi.com/Kronos/Iasion.html#Iasion Theoi Project: Iasion]


[[Category:Greek mythological people]]
{{Greek-myth-stub}}

[[lt:Jasionas]]</text>
    </revision>
