      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Helene''' (different from [[Helen]] of [[Troy]] and from [[Hellen]]) referred to two different people:

#A friend of [[Aphrodite]]'s.  Helene helped her seduce [[Adonis]].
#A daughter of [[Tityrus]] and an [[Amazons|Amazon]].  She fought [[Achilles]] and died after seriously wounding him.

