* [[Intangible culture]]
* [[Oral law]]
* [[Oral history]]
* [[Secondary orality]]
* [[Traditional knowledge]]
* [[Vedas]]
* [[Oral Torah]]
[[fr:Tradition orale]]
[[nn:munnleg overlevering]]


{{Socio-stub}}</text>
    </revision>
