      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], six people shared the name '''Periboea'''.

#Periboea was the daughter of King [[Cychreus]] of [[Salamis Island|Salamis]], first wife of King [[Telamon]] of Salamis and mother of [[Ajax the Great]]. 
#With [[Poseidon]], Periboea was the mother of [[Nausithous]].
#Wife of [[Polybus]], stepmother of [[Oedipus]]
#A [[Naiads|Naiad]] and wife of [[Icarius]], mother of [[Penelope]] and [[Perilaus]]
#Wife of [[Hipponous]] and mother of [[Tydeus]] by [[Oeneus]]
#Daughter of King [[Megareus]] and wife of [[Alcathous]].

[[Category:Greek mythological people]]</text>
    </revision>
