[[Category:1975 deaths|Schiøtz, Aksel]]
[[Category:Danish opera singers|Schiøtz, Aksel]]
[[Category:Tenors|Schiøtz, Aksel]]

[[da:Aksel Schiøtz]]
[[fi:Aksel Schiøtz]]</text>
