'''Somme''' is a French ''[[département in France|département]]'', named after the [[Somme River]], located in the north of [[France]]. It is part of the [[région in France|''région'']] of [[Picardie]].

The Somme was the site of many great battles of [[World War I]] with a number of monuments to soldiers from various countries.

==History==
* [[Battle of the Somme (1916)]]
* [[First Battle of the Somme (1918)]]
* [[Second Battle of the Somme (1918)]]

