Image:Venera1.jpg|First interplanetary probe
Image:Apollo 16 LM.jpg|First manned lunar lander
Image:Sojourner Rover taking measurements (large).jpg|First successful Mars rover
&lt;/gallery&gt;
&lt;/center&gt;
