**[[Mercury Orbiter]] - August 2009 - ISAS Mercury Orbiter (cancelled)
**[[Mars Science Laboratory]] - September 2009 - Mars Rover
**[[Mars Telecommunications Orbiter]] - Late 2009 - Communications Satellite, Technology Demonstrator (cancelled)
**[[Phobos-Grunt]] - 2009 - Phobos Sample Return
*[[2010]]
**[[Planet-C]] - June 2010 - [[JAXA]] Venus Orbiter
**[[Juno (spacecraft)|Juno]] - 2010 - Jupiter Orbiter
*[[2011]]
**[[Mars 2011]] - 2011 - scouting mission
**[[ExoMars]] - 2011 - ESA Mars Rover
*[[2012]]
**[[BepiColombo]] - Sep 2012 - ESA and ISAS Mercury Orbiters
*[[2015]]
**[[Jupiter Icy Moons Orbiter]] (JIMO) - Orbiter to [[Europa (moon)|Europa]], [[Ganymede (moon)|Ganymede]], and [[Callisto (moon)|Callisto]] (cancelled)
**[[Solar Orbiter]] - Solar Probe

