      <text xml:space="preserve">{{Taxobox
| color = lightgreen
| name = Figwort family
| image = Scrophularia nodosa8.jpg
| image_width = 240px
| image_caption = ''Scrophularia nodosa''
| regnum = [[Plant]]ae
| divisio = [[Flowering plant|Magnoliophyta]]
| classis = [[Magnoliopsida]]
