''[[Acanthus (genus)|Acanthus]]'' L. - bear's breech&lt;br&gt;
''[[Andrographis]]'' Wallich ex [[Christian Gottfried Daniel Nees von Esenbeck|Nees]] - false waterwillow&lt;br&gt;
