''[[Hygrophila]]'' R. Br. - swampweed&lt;br&gt;
''[[Hypoestes]]'' Soland. ex R. Br.&lt;br&gt;
''[[Justicia]]'' L. - justica, water-willow&lt;br&gt;
''[[Nelsonia]]'' R. Br.&lt;br&gt;
