      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Aegiale''' was the wife of [[Diomedes]].  While he was away fighting at the [[Trojan War]], she was unfaithful to him and he left her upon his return.

Aegiale was also the name of one of the [[Heliades]].

