[[Category:Aviation inventors|Cayley, George]]
[[Category:English inventors|Cayley, George]]
[[Category:Polymaths|Cayley, George]]
[[Category:Natives of Yorkshire|Cayley, George]]

[[de:George Cayley]]
[[es:George Cayley]]
[[fr:George Cayley]]
[[nl:George Cayley]]
[[ja:ジョージ・ケイリー]]</text>
    </revision>
