In [[Greek mythology]], '''Laodamia''' referred to two different women:

#Laodamia was the mother of [[Sarpedon]] by [[Zeus]], and a daughter of [[Bellerophon]].
#The wife of [[Protesilaus]] and daughter of [[Acastus]] and [[Astydameia]].  When her husband died during the [[Trojan War]], Laodamia killed herself in grief.

