      <minor />
      <comment>{{Greek-myth-stub}}</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Labdacus''' was the son of [[Polydorus]] and a King of [[Thebes (Greece)|Thebes]], ancestor of [[Oedipus]].  He was raised by [[Lycus]].  His descendants were called '''Labdacids''', and included [[Oedipus]], [[Laius]], [[Antigone]], [[Polynices]], [[Eteocles]] and [[Ismene]].

{{Greek-myth-stub}}

[[Category:Greek mythology]]
[[de:Labdakiden]]</text>
