== Records ==
*In [[2000]], Measure G was passed in Mendocino County with a 51% majority, making it the first county in the [[United States]] to decriminalize [[medical marijuana]].
*In [[2004]], Measure H was passed in Mendocino County with a 57% majority, making it the first county in the United States to ban the production of [[genetically modified organisms|GMOs]].

