*[[Palo Alto, California|Palo Alto]]
*[[San Jose, California|San Jose]] (incorporating the formerly independent unincorporated communities of [[Alum Rock, California|Alum Rock]], and [[Cambrian Park, California|Cambrian Park]], as well as the formerly independent incorporated cities of [[Willow Glen, California|Willow Glen]], [[East San Jose, California|East San Jose]], and [[Alviso, California|Alviso]])
*[[Santa Clara, California|Santa Clara]]
*[[Saratoga, California|Saratoga]]
*[[Sunnyvale, California|Sunnyvale]]

=== Unincorporated [[Census-designated Place|Census Designated Places]] ===
Unincorporated communities in the county include: 
