      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Hegetoria''' was a [[nymph]] who married [[Ochimus]].

They had a daughter, [[Cydippe]], who married Ochimus' brother, [[Cercaphus]], who then inherited the island. 

