      <comment>[[Category:Greek_mythology]]</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Dorus''' is the name of several individuals:

#Dorus was a son of [[Hellen]] and founder of the Dorian nation.
#Dorus was the son of [[Apollo]] and [[Phthia]], and the father of [[Xanthippe]].
#Dorus was the son of [[Xuthus]] and [[Creusa]].

[[Category:Greek_mythology]]
