      <text xml:space="preserve">Listed are the 102 [[County|counties]] of the [[U.S. state|state]] of [[Illinois]].  Current [[county seats]] are shown in parentheses.
[[Image:Illinois-counties-map.gif|right|450px|Illinois counties]]

==Current counties==
* [[Adams County, Illinois|Adams County]] ([[Quincy, Illinois|Quincy]])
* [[Alexander County, Illinois|Alexander County]] ([[Cairo, Illinois|Cairo]])
* [[Bond County, Illinois|Bond County]] ([[Greenville, Illinois|Greenville]])
* [[Boone County, Illinois|Boone County]] ([[Belvidere, Illinois|Belvidere]])
