      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>Reverted edits by [[Special:Contributions/151.198.226.201|151.198.226.201]] ([[User talk:151.198.226.201|talk]]) to last version by Lajkonik</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">== County Formation and County Seats ==
The following table lists [[New Jersey]]'s 21 counties, when and how they were created and their county seat:
[[Image:New-jersey-counties.gif|thumb|New Jersey counties]]
#[[Atlantic County, New Jersey|Atlantic County]]:  formed in 1837 from part of [[Gloucester County, New Jersey|Gloucester County]].  County seat: [[Mays Landing, New Jersey|Mays Landing]].
#[[Bergen County, New Jersey|Bergen County]]:  one of four original counties created in [[East Jersey]] in 1675.  County seat: [[Hackensack, New Jersey|Hackensack]].
#[[Burlington County, New Jersey|Burlington County]]: one of two original counties created in [[West Jersey]] in 1681.  County seat: [[Mount Holly Township, New Jersey|Mount Holly]].
#[[Camden County, New Jersey|Camden County]]:  formed in 1844 from part of [[Gloucester County, New Jersey|Gloucester County]].  County seat: [[Camden, New Jersey|Camden]].
#[[Cape May County, New Jersey|Cape May County]]:  formed in 1685 by [[West Jersey]] from part of [[Burlington County, New Jersey|Burlington County]].  County seat: [[Cape May Court House, New Jersey|Cape May Court House]].
#[[Cumberland County, New Jersey|Cumberland County]]:  formed in 1748 from part of [[Salem County, New Jersey|Salem County]].  County seat: [[Bridgeton, New Jersey|Bridgeton]].
#[[Essex County, New Jersey|Essex County]]:  one of four original counties created in [[East Jersey]] in 1675.  County seat: [[Newark, New Jersey|Newark]].
#[[Gloucester County, New Jersey|Gloucester County]]:  formed in 1686 by [[West Jersey]] from part of [[Burlington County, New Jersey|Burlington County]].  County seat: [[Woodbury, New Jersey|Woodbury]].
#[[Hudson County, New Jersey|Hudson County]]:  formed in 1840 from part of [[Bergen County, New Jersey|Bergen County]].  County seat: [[Jersey City, New Jersey|Jersey City]].
#[[Hunterdon County, New Jersey|Hunterdon County]]:  formed in 1714 from part of [[Burlington County, New Jersey|Burlington County]].  County seat: [[Flemington, New Jersey|Flemington]].
#[[Mercer County, New Jersey|Mercer County]]:  formed in 1838 from parts of [[Burlington County, New Jersey|Burlington County]], [[Hunterdon County, New Jersey|Hunterdon County]], [[Middlesex County, New Jersey|Middlesex County]], and [[Somerset County, New Jersey|Somerset County]].  County seat: [[Trenton, New Jersey|Trenton]].
#[[Middlesex County, New Jersey|Middlesex County]]:  one of four original counties created in [[East Jersey]] in 1675.  County seat: [[New Brunswick, New Jersey|New Brunswick]].
#[[Monmouth County, New Jersey|Monmouth County]]:  one of four original counties created in [[East Jersey]] in 1675.  County seat: [[Freehold Borough, New Jersey|Freehold]].
#[[Morris County, New Jersey|Morris County]]:  formed in 1739 from part of [[Hunterdon County, New Jersey|Hunterdon County]].  County seat: [[Morristown, New Jersey|Morristown]].
#[[Ocean County, New Jersey|Ocean County]]:  formed in 1850 from part of [[Monmouth County, New Jersey|Monmouth County]].  County seat: [[Toms River, New Jersey|Toms River]].
#[[Passaic County, New Jersey|Passaic County]]: formed in 1837 from parts of [[Bergen County, New Jersey|Bergen County]] and [[Essex County, New Jersey|Essex County]]. County seat: [[Paterson, New Jersey|Paterson]].
#[[Salem County, New Jersey|Salem County]]:  one of two original counties created in [[West Jersey]] in 1681.  County seat: [[Salem, New Jersey|Salem]].
#[[Somerset County, New Jersey|Somerset County]]:  formed in 1688 from part of [[Middlesex County, New Jersey|Middlesex County]]. County seat: [[Somerville, New Jersey|Somerville]].
#[[Sussex County, New Jersey|Sussex County]]:  formed in 1753 from part of [[Morris County, New Jersey|Morris County]].  County seat: [[Newton, New Jersey|Newton]].
#[[Union County, New Jersey|Union County]]:  formed in 1857 from part of [[Essex County, New Jersey|Essex County]].  County seat: [[Elizabeth, New Jersey|Elizabeth]].
#[[Warren County, New Jersey|Warren County]]:  formed in 1824 from part of [[Sussex County, New Jersey|Sussex County]].  County seat: [[Belvidere, New Jersey|Belvidere]].

