* [http://www.elook.org/literature/dumas/the-count-of-monte-cristo/ eLook Literature: The Count of Monte Cristo] - HTML version broken down chapter by chapter.
* [http://www.sparknotes.com/lit/montecristo/ An in-depth analysis of the book, its themes, and characters] with chapter by chapter summaries and analysis.
