*[[Ingalls Park, Illinois|Ingalls Park]]
*[[Joliet, Illinois|Joliet]] - small section in [[Kendall County, Illinois|Kendall County]]
*[[Lakewood Shores, Illinois|Lakewood Shores]]
*[[Lockport, Illinois|Lockport]]
*[[Manhattan, Illinois|Manhattan]]
*[[Mokena, Illinois|Mokena]]
