      <text xml:space="preserve">__NOTOC__
Index: {{compactTOC}}
&lt;div style=&quot;float:right;width:300px;margin-left:5px&quot;&gt;[[Image:Texas counties map.gif|thumb]]&lt;/div&gt;

==A==
*[[Anderson County, Texas|Anderson County]] formed in 1846 from part of Houston County.
*[[Andrews County, Texas|Andrews County]] formed in 1876 from Bexar County.
*[[Angelina County, Texas|Angelina County]] formed in 1846 from part of Nacogdoches County.
*[[Aransas County, Texas|Aransas County]] formed in 1871 from part of Refugio County.
*[[Archer County, Texas|Archer County]] formed in 1858 from part of Clay County.
*[[Armstrong County, Texas|Armstrong County]] formed in 1876 from Bexar County.
*[[Atascosa County, Texas|Atascosa County]] formed in 1856 from Bexar County.
*[[Austin County, Texas|Austin County]] formed in 1836. One of the original counties, was a &quot;municipio&quot; called San Felipe de Austin and capital of the &quot;departamento&quot; of Brazos under Mexican rule.

==B==
*[[Bailey County, Texas|Bailey County]] formed in 1876 from Bexar County.
*[[Bandera County, Texas|Bandera County]] formed in 1856 from Bexar County.
*[[Bastrop County, Texas|Bastrop County]] formed in 1836. One of the original counties, was called Mina until 1837. Was a &quot;municipio&quot; under Mexican rule.
*[[Baylor County, Texas|Baylor County]] formed in 1858 from part of Fannin County.
*[[Bee County, Texas|Bee County]] formed in 1857 from parts of San Patricio County, Goliad County, Refugio County, Live Oak County, and Karnes County.
*[[Bell County, Texas|Bell County]] formed in 1850 from part of Milam County.
