[[Category:Norwegian mathematicians|Wessel, Caspar]]
[[Category:18th century mathematicians|Wessel, Caspar]]
[[Category:19th century mathematicians|Wessel, Caspar]]

[[no:Caspar Wessel]]
[[pl:Caspar Wessel]]
[[sv:Caspar Wessel]]
[[zh:卡斯帕尔·韦塞尔]]</text>
