{{multi-listen end}}

==Books==
*Cessac, Catherine. ''Marc-Antoine Charpentier''. Paris: Fayard, 1988.
*Ranum, Patricia. Portraits around Marc-Antoine Charpentier. Baltimore: Dux Femina Facti, 2004. ISBN 0966099737.

