*[[FOCUS]], a domain-specific programming language for data handling and analysis
*[[FOCUS (hardware)]], a CPU architecture
*[[FOCUS (newsmagazine)]], the second largest German newsmagazine
*[[FOCUS Program]], a voluntary study program at Duke University
*[[FOCUS Brands, Inc.]]
*[[Focus (DIY) Ltd]] a UK chain of DIY stores
