      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Västernorrland County''', or ''Västernorrlands län'' is a [[Counties of Sweden|county]] or ''[[län]]'' in the north of [[Sweden]]. It is bordered by the counties of [[Gävleborg County|Gävleborg]], [[Jämtland County|Jämtland]], [[Västerbotten County|Västerbotten]] and the [[Gulf of Bothnia]].

