The arms for the County of Västernorrland are a combination of those of [[Ångermanland]], and of [[Medelpad]]. When it is shown with a royal crown it represents the County Administrative Board. Blazon: &quot;Parted per pale, the arms of Angermanniaand the arms of Medelpad.&quot;

