      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Abraham Darby''' is the name shared by three generations of an [[England|English]] [[Religious Society of Friends|Quaker]] family that was key to the development of the [[Industrial Revolution]].
*[[Abraham Darby I]] (1678&amp;ndash;1717)
*[[Abraham Darby II]] (1711&amp;ndash;1763)
*[[Abraham Darby III]] (1750&amp;ndash;1791)
