  <page>
    <title>IDM</title>
    <id>82375</id>
    <revision>
      <id>38628523</id>
      <timestamp>2006-02-07T16:19:09Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Chlewbot</username>
        <id>620581</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>robot  Adding: es</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''IDM''' is an acronym that can refer to different things, depending on context:
* In electronic music, [[intelligent dance music|intelligent dance music]]
* In information technology, [[Intelligent Device Management]]
* In information technology, [[Identity management]]
* [[Intranet Design Magazine]]
* In medicine, [[infant]] of a [[diabetic]] [[mother]]
* [[Integrated Data Modem]]
* [[Improved Data Modem]]
* [[Integrated Diagnostic Modem]]
* [[Integrated Document Management]]
* [[Integrated Device Manufacturer]]
* In [[Germany]], the [[Internationale Deutsche Motorradmeisterschaft]]
* A biopharmaceutical company, [[IDM Ltd]] [http://www.idm-biotech.com]
* The [[Trades Union Congress]] journal [[International Development Matters]]

{{TLAdisambig}}

[[es:Idm]]
[[nl:IDM]]</text>
    </revision>
